{
  "host_id": "deepseek-dsh",
  "host_api_version": "1.1",
  "aliases": [
    "dsh",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "deepseek"
  ],
  "support": {
    "level": "preview",
    "display_name": "DeepSeek Harness (dsh)",
    "evidence": null,
    "limitations": [
      "DSH 处于 developer preview（0.2.x RC），插件、profile 与 bundle 约定可能随版本变化；升级前用 dsh --version 与 --dump-config 核对。",
      "命令以 Skill 薄入口投影；DSH 的 Skill 名只接受 kebab-case，/aegis:<command> 在本宿主对应 /aegis-<command> 触发别名。",
      "原生安装从 npm 获取 @eliterncn/aegisharness-dsh（dsh plugin --profile <name> add）；包发布前只能用 installer.md 的开发者安装方式。",
      "插件通过 ctx.skills.register 注册运行时 Skill，不写 $DSH_HOME/skills 文件；需要文件形式时用 installer.md 的 skills 目录方案。",
      "遥测与插件自动更新适配器未接入，升级用 dsh plugin --profile <name> add <pkg>@latest。",
      "项目级 hook 未写入宿主设置文件，质量检查由公共命令与 docs/hooks/ 清单显式驱动。",
      "未经真实产品会话的完整生命周期 E2E，支持等级为 preview。"
    ]
  },
  "capabilities": {
    "command_surface": "emulated",
    "skill_discovery": "native",
    "session_start": "unsupported",
    "stop_hook": "unsupported",
    "failure_hook": "unsupported",
    "command_lifecycle": "emulated",
    "workflow_transition": "emulated",
    "subagents": "native",
    "unit_test_workflow": "emulated",
    "task_tracking": "emulated",
    "project_hooks": "unsupported",
    "session_events": "unsupported",
    "telemetry": "unsupported",
    "plugin_install": "native",
    "plugin_update": "unsupported",
    "session_end": "unsupported"
  },
  "adapters": {
